Done. Spec created for APDS-9960.

**Deliverables:**
- `artifacts/apds9960/outputs/spec_apds9960.md` — full spec (I²C `0x39`, 400 kHz; pin table; 43-register map with reset values; bit fields; init sequence; data conversion with ATIME/WTIME count formulas and worked test vectors)
- `artifacts/apds9960/outputs/esphome_component.txt`, `apds9960.mdx`, and `apds9960/` (esphome source)
- `artifacts/apds9960/prompt0a/datasheet/apds9960_datasheet.md` (1484-line extraction) + PDF
- `feedback/apds9960/prompt0a.md`

Notes: datasheet PDF was a false-flag "encrypted" report (qpdf confirmed clean). STATUS register reset value is inconsistent in the datasheet (`0x00` table vs `0x04` description) — recorded both. No direct Lux formula exists; documented responsivity + ESPHome's full-scale percentage conversion instead.
